# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SOURCE RECORDS: one row per publication, population and endpoint
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These are the records that fitted something.  A record is "ready" only when
# what this package can execute of it -- a concentration curve, or an endpoint
# function evaluated against a concentration the caller supplies -- reproduces
# the source.  bp_simulation_enabled stays FALSE even then, because none of
# these records has a complete dose -> concentration -> blood pressure chain
# with a published baseline: either the blood-pressure coefficients are
# missing, or the PK is, or the endpoint is not a resting blood pressure.
#
# Verification of every individual number is recorded per parameter in
# inst/extdata/antihypertensiveParameters.csv.  Three sources were read as
# full text or as a complete abstract and their numbers are verified; the
# rest are the handoff specification's transcription, which could not be
# checked because this container cannot reach the publishers (see
# docs/antihypertensives.md).

